# Agent documentation after implementation

After **each** implementation step (not only at milestone end):

1. Run **pytest** for layers touched (`pytest` before handoff).
2. **Append** to [agent/JOURNAL.md](../../agent/JOURNAL.md) (newest first) using
   the entry format in that file: context, decision, alternatives rejected,
   files affected, follow-ups. Do not skip for “small” steps.
3. Update **task-routing** agent docs per [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md):

| Change | Doc |
|--------|-----|
| Board deploy / wiring | `agent/HARDWARE.md` |
| New names / catalog | `agent/GLOSSARY.md` |
| Datasheet fact | `agent/DATASHEET.md` |
| Tests / HIL | `agent/TESTING.md` |
| Milestone | `agent/STATUS.md` |
| Permanent invariant | `agent/DESIGN_DECISIONS.md` |

Do **not** read JOURNAL during implementation (write-only). Do **not** duplicate
hex register values in markdown — reference `WORKED_*` in conftest.

See also [adf435x-development SKILL](../../.cursor/skills/adf435x-development/SKILL.md).
